    summary: "The Bible uses several pictures to explain what Christ accomplished on the cross. This lesson begins with the picture of sacrifice, from the Old Testament offerings and the Day of Atonement to the once-for-all offering of Christ in Hebrews.",
    scripture: ["Hebrews 10:1-14", "Leviticus 16:15-22"], more: ["Exodus 12:1-13", "John 1:29", "1 John 2:1-2"], memory: "Hebrews 10:14",
