    apply: "Read Isaiah 53 aloud, replacing 'he' and 'our' with 'Jesus' and 'my', and notice how personal it becomes. Thank him for specific sins he bore for you. When tempted to be proud or judgmental, remember that all you have in God's sight is a gift.",
