    apply: "Identify one area of bondage in your life, such as a habit, fear or grudge, and bring it to Christ in prayer, asking him to free you. Seek help from a trusted friend or pastor. Give thanks daily that you were bought with a price and use your body and time this week to honour God.",
    activity: "Set up a role-play of a slave market, with a person for sale and another who pays the price. Discuss what the person feels. Then read Mark 10:45 and 1 Peter 1:18-19 and ask how the picture applies to Christ. Pray together for those in bondage.",
